{"quest_id": 8195, "name": "第七陣 物質界への侵攻", "description": "同盟軍は冥界から前線拠点に戻るも、\nそこは竜人族の襲撃を受けた後であった。\n＜広域戦闘：敵味方の射程減少＞\n神級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv50）", "modifier_notes": ["広域戦闘：敵味方の射程減少"], "event": "帝国七陣", "event_category": "Empire", "mission_id": 940001, "map_no": 4786, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 90, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 48, "params": [65]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 19, "params": [65]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 49, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098416, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 85, "global_id": 84, "spawn_sec": 29}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 170, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098432, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 87, "global_id": 86, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 34}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 70, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2140208, "race_id": 2, "special_effect_id": 234, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 1, "missile_id": 45, "master_id": 35320, "global_id": 8937, "ranged": true, "variants": [{"hp": 6000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2140224, "race_id": 2, "special_effect_id": 621, "master_id": 35321, "global_id": 8938}], "spawn_sec": 63}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098528, "race_id": 2, "master_id": 30576, "global_id": 4195, "spawn_sec": 63}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 400, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098544, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 293, "global_id": 292, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 86}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 20000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 400, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2130992, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 34095, "global_id": 7712, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 88}], "popups": ["発光するマスに配置した\nユニットは射程が\n上昇します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ルークス", "text": "――臆するな！\nすぐに陛下が、我が帝国の誇る飛空戦艦がここへ来る！", "face": "u422"}, {"name": "エリック", "text": "ちっ……そうは言ってもなぁ！\n門は破られたし、陣形もめちゃくちゃだぞ！？\n敵もどれだけ抜けていったことか！", "face": "u419"}, {"name": "ルークス", "text": "それでも、だ。エリック。\n我らが退路を確保せねば、\n帝国軍は進むべき道を失うのだ。", "face": "u422"}, {"name": "エリック", "text": "ちくしょう……。\nこうなったら元帥殿に直談判だ。\n特別報奨に危険手当に勲章も付けてもらうぞ！！", "face": "u419"}, {"name": "レオラ", "text": "――えぇ、もちろん約束するわ。\n総員地上へ！　冥界拠点守備隊に合流なさい！", "face": "u464"}, {"name": "白の皇帝", "text": "…………待たせたな。\n状況を報告しろ。", "face": "u418"}, {"name": "ドワイト", "text": "はっ！\n先刻、冥界拠点に竜人部隊が急襲。\nすでに多数の敵の通過を許し……。", "face": "u348"}, {"name": "レオナ", "text": "貴様の責任ではない。\n戦力配置を見誤った、私にこそ責任はある。\nよく、ここまで耐えてくれたな。", "face": "u311"}, {"name": "ドワイト", "text": "……っ！　はっ、恐縮です！", "face": "u348"}, {"name": "レオナ", "text": "陛下、もはや一刻の猶予もありません。\nこの地の竜人部隊を撃破し、\n物質界を目指しましょう。", "face": "u311"}, {"name": "白の皇帝", "text": "ああ。\n……全軍、剣をとれ。", "face": "u418"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "カーナ", "text": "――陛下、報告です。\nこの先の通路に、\n竜人の手によるものと思われる縦穴がありました。", "face": "u1107a1"}, {"name": "へカティエ", "text": "この先は、冥界と物質界の隣接した場所よ。\n奴ら、それを知って突入口を開いたということね。", "face": "u1226a1"}, {"name": "レオナ", "text": "フォーラ、縦穴を確認しろ。\n飛空戦艦で通過可能か調べるんだ。\nクリッペ、キンドライヒ、護衛につけ。", "face": "u311"}, {"name": "フォーラ", "text": "はっ！\nまたトンネル曲芸飛行かぁぁぁ……。", "face": "u1921a1"}, {"name": "クリッペ", "text": "めげないしょげない！\nそれだけフォーラの\n操艦技術が認められてるってことだよ。", "face": "u2084a1"}, {"name": "キンドライヒ", "text": "うまく切り抜けたら、\nたぶん美味しいカリカリとかくれるはずだぞ。", "face": "u2086a1"}, {"name": "レオナ", "text": "残りの者は物資と負傷者の移送を急げ！\nこの先は……。…………ッ。", "face": "u311"}, {"name": "白の皇帝", "text": "…………俺が伝えよう。", "face": "u418"}, {"name": "白の皇帝", "text": "敵は既に、帝国領内に侵入している。\n敵の目的は領土奪還ではない。\n此度の作戦目標は、命を奪うことにあるそうだ。", "face": "u418"}, {"name": "ルークス", "text": "なっ……。", "face": "u422"}, {"name": "ラビリス", "text": "ああ、こいつの言ってることは間違いない。", "face": "u2087a1"}, {"name": "ラビリス", "text": "ここまでの領土奪還は、いわば前哨戦。\nハイドースの目的は、この先の儀式完遂にある。", "face": "u2087a1"}, {"name": "ラビリス", "text": "その儀式が何を目的としているか、\nそこまでは教えちゃくれなかったが、\n人の命を捧げるものなんて、ろくなもんじゃねぇ。", "face": "u2087a1"}, {"name": "フォーラ", "text": "――待たせた！\nみんな、縦穴は飛空戦艦で航行可能だ！\n乗艦を急いで！！", "face": "u1921a1"}, {"name": "白の皇帝", "text": "行くぞ、祖国の……民のために。", "face": "u418"}]}], "hard": {"level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 48, "params": [65]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 19, "params": [65]}, {"kind": "term", "influence": 12, "params": [200]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "form_index": 0, "hp": 1200, "attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "pattern_id": 2098416}, {"enemy_id": 2, "form_index": 0, "hp": 1000, "attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "pattern_id": 2098432}, {"enemy_id": 3, "form_index": 0, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "pattern_id": 2140208}, {"enemy_id": 5, "form_index": 0, "hp": 4000, "attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "pattern_id": 2098528}, {"enemy_id": 6, "form_index": 0, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 400, "pattern_id": 2098544}, {"enemy_id": 7, "form_index": 0, "hp": 20000, "attack": 600, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 400, "pattern_id": 2130992}]}, "active": true}